  <h2>Step-by-Step Examples of Right Triangle Area Using Inradius and Semiperimeter</h2>
  <p>Four classic right triangles show the full chain: sides to semiperimeter, sides to inradius, then the single multiplication. In these examples r and s are derived from the side lengths; the calculator itself accepts r and s directly.</p>

